WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.940
In 1521, in the city of Worms, Martin
Luther stands before the emperor and church

2
00:00:05.990 --> 00:00:06.920
leaders.

3
00:00:06.970 --> 00:00:09.660
He is told to take back his teaching.

4
00:00:09.710 --> 00:00:11.150
He refuses.

5
00:00:11.200 --> 00:00:15.150
Christians still argue about what should
decide when their authorities seem to

6
00:00:15.200 --> 00:00:16.270
clash.

7
00:00:16.320 --> 00:00:18.850
And if the Bible says
nothing about a choice,

8
00:00:18.900 --> 00:00:21.630
how do Christians decide what is right?

9
00:00:21.680 --> 00:00:26.910
In this mission, you'll find out why John
Henry Newman once raised a famous toast.

10
00:00:26.960 --> 00:00:31.940
Then you'll compare how Catholics,
Protestants and Quakers answer the question.

11
00:00:31.990 --> 00:00:37.410
Your mission: find out how Christians decide
what is right when the Bible is silent.
